    <http://example.org/node/chunk223> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we can propose an AI solution that leverages we expertise in large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned to improve the quality of answers and reduce processing times.  we can integrate Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct into the existing system of information using APIs, allowing for seamless interaction with various business software, civil status, town planning, and electronic management of documents (EDM). we experience with vector stores like Qdrant, Weaviate, and pgvector will enable we to efficiently manage and retrieve relevant information." ;
