        ex:hasText "To ensure explainability and transparency, we can implement techniques like source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME. implement will provide insights into the decision-making process of the AI solution and facilitate trust in the system. we RAG capabilities, including dense vector semantic retrieval, BM25 sparse retrieval, and hybrid (RRF fusion) strategies, will enable the AI solution to effectively retrieve relevant information from internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents. retrieve will assist agents in agents daily missions, improve answer quality, and reduce processing times. we can also propose a progressive deployment approach, starting with a pilot phase on a limited scope and gradually generalizing to the entirety of the services." ;
