    <http://example.org/node/chunk240> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our capabilities and experience, our propose a project management plan that aligns with the client's requirements for a progressive deployment. our typical delivery structure consists of four phases: Inception & Design, Pilot/MVP, Full Rollout, and Operations & Support." ;
