    <http://example.org/node/chunk247> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "**Proposal for Artificial Intelligence Solution of Assistance to Agents** We are pleased to submit Proposal for Artificial Intelligence Solution of Assistance to Agents in response to the call for tenders issued by the City of Belval for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message20> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk248> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We team has carefully reviewed the requirements and constraints outlined in the tender document, and We are confident that an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents meets all the necessary criteria. **Introduction** the City of Belval is confronted with a growing complexity of procedures, multiplicity of information sources, and an increase in the volume of requests to process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message20> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk249> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address a growing complexity of procedures, multiplicity of information sources, and an increase in the volume of requests to process, the City of Belval requires an artificial intelligence solution that can assist agents in agents administrative activities, improve the efficiency of administrative services, and enhance the quality of service rendered to users. an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents is designed to meet these needs and provide a tool of assistance to agents, ensuring continuity of file processing between agents and services. **Solution Overview** an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents is an artificial intelligence-powered intelligent assistance tool that will be integrated with the existing system of information, including business software, civil status, town planning, electronic management of documents (EDM), and user directories. an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents will provide agents with quick access to reliable and up-to-date information, enabling agents to make informed decisions and improve the quality of agents responses to users. an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents will also facilitate the sharing of relevant information, understanding of the context of ongoing files, and effective resumption of processing by another agent. **Key Features** an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents includes the following key features: 1. **Information Search**: an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents will enable agents to search for information in internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents, guides, notes, and repositories. 2. **Drafting Assistance**: an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents will provide help with drafting administrative contents, including answers to users, administrative letters, and syntheses of files. 3. **Contextualization**: an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents will contextualize answers in function of the demand of the agent, taking into account the context of the file when available. 4. **Explainability and Transparency**: an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents will guarantee explainability and transparency, allowing agents to understand the elements that have led to an answer or suggestion. 5. **Security and Compliance**: an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents will comply with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and ensure the protection of data through encryption and anonymization if necessary. **Technical Requirements** an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents meets all the technical requirements outlined in the tender document, including: 1. **Hosting**: an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents will be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union. 2. **Security**: an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents will comply with SecNumCloud or equivalent security standards. 3. **Integration**: an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents will integrate with the existing system of information, including business software, civil status, town planning, EDM, and user directories. 4. **API**: an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents will have an API interface to facilitate integration with other systems. **Environmental Considerations** We are committed to reducing the environmental footprint of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents. an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact, and We will ensure that We implementation approach minimizes energetic consumption. **Deployment and Training** an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents will be deployed in a progressive manner, with a pilot phase on a limited scope and a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message20> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk25> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk250> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We will also provide training for agents to ensure a smooth transition and optimal use of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents. **Evaluation Criteria** We believe that an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents meets all the evaluation criteria outlined in the tender document, including: 1. **Quality and Relevance**: an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents provides high-quality and relevant responses to users. 2. **Compliance**: an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents complies with regulatory requirements, including GDPR. 3. **Security**: an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents ensures the protection of data through encryption and anonymization if necessary. 4. **Global Cost**: an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents offers a competitive global cost, taking into account the environmental issues and capacity for innovation. **Conclusion** In conclusion, an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents meets all the requirements and constraints outlined in the tender document." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message20> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk251> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We are confident that an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents will improve the efficiency of administrative services, enhance the quality of service rendered to users, and provide a tool of assistance to agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message20> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk252> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We look forward to the opportunity to discuss an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents in further detail and demonstrate how an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents can meet the needs of the City of Belval." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message20> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk26> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk27> a prov:Entity ;
