    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed Architecture: - The solution will leverage our expertise in AI/ML systems, specifically in large language models (LLMs) and large language models (LLMs) integration with existing information systems. - For hosting, our propose using a European cloud provider such as OVHcloud or Scaleway that offers infrastructure certified to SecNumCloud type or equivalent within the EU to ensure sovereignty and compliance with GDPR. - API integration will be achieved through RESTful APIs or GraphQL, depending on the specific requirements of the existing information systems and user directories. our experience with API gateways will ensure secure and managed access to API integration. - To achieve high availability and response times below 2 seconds, our will deploy The solution on a containerized platform (using Docker and Kubernetes) that allows for easy scaling and load balancing. - Security will be ensured through the implementation of encryption at rest and in transit, robust authentication mechanisms, and thorough secrets management practices." ;
